Phase 9 — Full redesign "v2" (branch redesign-v2): @in-progress
  Goal: rework the whole product — patient, staff, admin — into one polished,
  organized, premium application. Design authority: the model. DESIGN.md v2.
  R1 — DESIGN SYSTEM ✔
    New indigo-violet seed (#5B4FE9) from the logo + AppColors.brandGradient
    (used only: login mark, one hero per role, empty-state CTA). Flat surfaces:
    hairline border + Shadows.e1/e2/e3 tokens, off M3 surface-tint. Type gets
    size-specific tracking (headlines tightened). lib/app/theme/motion.dart:
    Motion tokens + Pressable (press-scale) + AppPageTransitions (fade-through).
    app_theme.dart reworked (flat appbar/nav, pill status, softer inputs).
  R1 — SHARED COMPONENTS ✔
    lib/core/presentation/: app_card.dart (AppCard, SectionHeader{overline},
    MetricTile, InlineBanner), app_scaffold.dart (AppScaffold). states.dart
    polished (icon medallion, reduce-motion skeletons, card-shaped SkeletonList).
    SectionHeader moved out of confirm_dialog.dart → app_card.dart.
  R2/R3 — SCREENS
    Done: login, register, patient home (time-aware greeting + health-snapshot
    metrics + quick-action grid), staff dashboard (shift metric row), admin
    dashboard (metric grid + link cards), task board, vitals, panel analytics,
    appointments, staff + patient profile (ProfileHeader), preferences section,
    system analytics (MetricTile grid), audit log, departments, medications,
    timeline, staff patients, staff schedule, AI summary, record detail,
    patient chart, booking slot list, nav shell (hairline separators).
    greeting()/visitTypeLabel in format.dart. AppCard is Material-backed
    (nested ListTiles need an ink host).
    Theme-only (functional, not hand-polished): user management, ai settings,
    chart write sheets — they inherit the new tokens but keep their old layout.
  R4 — IA (deferred): patient Home/Health/Appointments/Profile; admin
    Overview/People/Departments/System/Profile. Router + tests — after screens.

